  "name": "Ultra Ball League",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "Ultra Ball League tournaments are held in Malaysia, Singapore and the Philippines, later also in Indonesia, and in 2025-26 in Taiwan, Hong Kong and Thailand as well. Players got a copy with the Ultra Ball League logo: a holo 151 Mew ex, Paradox Rift's Professor Turo's Scenario and Shrouded Fable's Colress's Tenacity, Journey Together's Iris's Fighting Spirit for a third season, then cosmos holo Wally's Compassion, Lillie's Determination and Dawn for the first, second and third seasons of 2025-26. The top players of those three seasons won a holo Zekrom ex.",
